[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ふぅ……\r\n今日の仕事はちょっと時間かかったな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00004",
    "bgm": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0116",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030020010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれ？　灯織じゃないか\r\nこんな時間までどうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ……プロデューサー\r\nお疲れ様です",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "少し時間があったので\r\nさっきまで自主レッスンをしていました",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう言えば、スケジュールを組んだとき\r\nダンスを重点的にやる期間だって言ってたな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "覚えていてくれたんですね",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そりゃあ覚えてるさ\r\n遅くまでお疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ありがとうございます……\r\nでも、やる度に自分ができないことに気付かされて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……灯織\r\nもしかして、何か悩んでるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え？\r\nいえ、そんなことは……ないと思いますが",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "人に話して解決することもあると思うぞ\r\n良かったら、俺に話してくれないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……はい、そうですね\r\nプロデューサーの言うとおり、最近行き詰まっていて",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……でも、俺が前に見た時には\r\nかなり仕上がってるように見えたんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "振り付けどおりにできているとは思います\r\nでも、最後のポーズが今ひとつなんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "キメのポーズか……\r\n自分ではどう感じてるんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですね……動画を撮って見返してみても\r\n迫力がなく、印象に残らないような……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "迫力……\r\nもしかしたら、メリハリが足りてないんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "メリハリ、ですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。他のアイドルのダンスの動画なんだが……\r\nこれを見てくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "かなりアレンジをきかせてるけど\r\n緩急があって、最後はビシッと決まってるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "すごいですね……\r\n最後のポーズに引き込まれるような……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "振り付けをなぞるだけじゃなくて、\r\n灯織がどう見せたいのかを動きに取り入れてもいいかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー……ありがとうございます！\r\nさっそく、今から試してきます",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もうかなり遅い時間だぞ？　\r\n今日は休んだ方が良い",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ……そうですよね、すみません",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その様子だと、ご飯も食べてないんじゃないか？\r\nダメだぞ？　身体が資本なんだから、しっかり食べないと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……プロデューサーこそ\r\nこんな時間までお仕事して、ちゃんと食べたんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれ？　そう言えば、俺も今日はまだだったな\r\n灯織のこと言えないな……すまん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ……お互い様、ですね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010150"
  },
  {
    "select": "今から食べに行くか",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "似たもの同士って\r\nことかな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "携帯食ならあるぞ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010160,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え？　でも、この時間だと空いているお店もないですし\r\n今日はもう我慢しようかと……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……実は、近くに夜までやってるお店があるんだ\r\nだけど、オシャレすぎて男ひとりじゃ入りづらいんだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、やっぱり我慢は良くない\r\nしっかりと食べないとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そういうことなら……私もご一緒させてください",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……ありがとうございます、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010190,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "今まで考えたこともありませんでしたが……\r\n意外と、そうなのかもしれませんね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『意外と』とはなんだ、『意外と』とは……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふっ、\r\nごめんなさい、他意はないんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ただ、そんな風に思えるって\r\n考えたことなかったので……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010220,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……プロデューサー\r\nいつもそういうので済ませてるんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　いつもってわけじゃないけど……\r\nまぁ、たまには……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "確かに便利ですけど\r\nちゃんと食べなきゃだめですよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003010240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『身体は資本』って、\r\n自分で言ったばかりなんですから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200301/2002003010240"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]